Benchmark fixtures for `polyphar benchmark` and `bin/polyphar-dogsite-worker --benchmark`.

sample_pockets/   The 16 pocket files of PocketMatch v2.0 `alpha-file_maker/Sample_pockets`,
                  copied unmodified from https://github.com/1337deepesh/PocketMatch_v2.0
                  at commit 4648bff3c4d233104c6d1f4ced351b5f7944972a.
                  PocketMatch is licensed GPL-3.0 (see the upstream repository);
                  these files remain under that licence.
2mjw_B.pdb, 6l49_A.pdb, 5nmm_A.pdb
                  PDB chains extracted from RCSB entries 2MJW, 6L49 and 5NMM (public
                  data), used as DoGSiteScorer / pdbfixer timing inputs.
2mjw_A_fixed.pdb  chain A of 2MJW after polyphar.stages.fix.fix_one (pH 7.0).
2mjw_A_pocket.pdb DoGSiteScorer pocket P_1 of that chain (docking box).
edrug3d_bench3.sdf  records ID 89, 514 and 666 (24 heavy atoms each = the library median) of the e-Drug3D library (e-Drug3D_2083.sdf),
                  unchanged (docking timing).
accessions.txt    100 reviewed human UniProt accessions (UniProt request timing).
